      "content": "i know you're saying to see a doctor but i literally just told you i'm a student and i can't afford that right now. i'm not trying to push my limits, i'm just trying to deal with this. since the cream isn't working, is there any way i can use a topical steroid with the antifungal to speed it up? also, i'm starting to feel really shaky and kind of dizzy, which is making me super anxious. if i can't go to a clinic tonight, is there any combo of over the counter stuff that can help settle my stomach and the shaking so i can at least sleep? like, would a bunch of benadryl be okay to help me relax through the jitters?",
